**Interface** — `BotReviewOptions` (`src/cli/bot.ts`). Target: adds `readonly inPlace?: boolean`. `withBotOptions` adds `--in-place`, and `withBotInput` forwards it only when true. `BotReviewInput` (`src/bot/review-run.ts`) and `BotFixInput` (`src/bot/fix-run.ts`). Target: each adds `readonly inPlace?: boolean` (both added in US-006). `_botReviewDeps` (`src/bot/review-deps.ts`) gains `prepareInPlaceCheckout`. The US-005 seam `prepareInPlaceCheckout(input: { repoRoot; ref; info; suffix }): Promise<PrCheckout>` is called by `runBotReview`; seam ACs enter at that function.
